<div id="cookieModal" class="cookieModal">
	<div class="card">
		<div class="content">
            <h3>Oh look, another cookie consent banner!</h3>
            <p>
                Surprise! We're legally obligated to tell you we use cookies, as if anyone didn't know that
                websites track everything these days. We could write paragraphs explaining what cookies are,
                but let's be honest – you've seen this message 37 times today already.
            </p>
            <p>
                Accept our cookies and we'll promise to collect just enough data to keep our lawyers happy,
                while pretending we won't remember your entire browsing history. That's our cookie guarantee!
            </p>
            <p><a href="#">Read more here!</a></p>
		</div>
        <form id="cookieConsentForm" class="settings">
            <div class="text-container">
                <h4>Cookies</h4>
                <div class="options">
                    <div class="option">
                        <label class="switch-label" for="cookieEssential">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i>
                            Essential (alltid aktiva)
                        </label>
                        <div class="form-check form-switch">
                            <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="cookieEssential" name="essential" checked disabled>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="option">
                        <label class="switch-label" for="cookieFunctional">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i>
                            Functional
                        </label>
                        <div class="form-check form-switch">
                            <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="cookieFunctional" name="functional">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="option">
                        <label class="switch-label" for="cookieAnalytics">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i>
                            Analytics
                        </label>
                        <div class="form-check form-switch">
                            <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="cookieAnalytics" name="analytics">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="option">
                        <label class="switch-label" for="cookieMarketing">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i>
                            Marketing
                        </label>
                        <div class="form-check form-switch">
                            <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="cookieMarketing" name="marketing">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
			<div class="buttons">
				<button type="button" class="btn btn-dark" onclick="acceptAll()">Accept All</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-dark" onclick="acceptSelected()">Accept Selected</button>
            </div>
        </form>
	</div>
</div>

<div class="cookieConsentIcon" onclick="showCookieModal()">
    <i class="fa-solid fa-cookie-bite"></i>
</div>